{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/hq-by-rove-irth-development-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1275,"crm_id":"5976","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"HQ by Rove","slug":"hq-by-rove-irth-development-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["studio","offices"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Irth Development","price":2650000,"display_price":"2.65M","lattitude":25.191546203671,"longitude":55.29167599259,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>HQ by Rove Dubai is redefining the future of work with the Middle East’s first hospitality-branded office spaces. Developed by IRTH Group in collaboration with Rove Hotels, this landmark commercial project brings a lifestyle-first approach to the workplace. Located in the heart of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/business-bay/\">Business Bay</a>, the development features 26 floors of modular offices and loft-style spaces, each designed with Rove’s bold, contemporary aesthetic and complete with private outdoor patios and smart furniture.</p><p>Blending efficiency with lifestyle, Rove HQ Business Bay is more than just a workplace. Tenants enjoy panoramic views of Downtown Dubai and the Dubai Canal. With Rove HQ amenities spanning over 120,000 sq. ft., including wellness pods, a fitness centre, rooftop social hubs, food halls, co-working lounges, and even floating treehouse cabins, the project sets a new standard of luxury workplaces.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Rove_HQ_Business_Bay_Hospitality_Branded_Offices_c7eb89192c.jpg","hash":"Rove_HQ_Business_Bay_Hospitality_Branded_Offices_c7eb89192c","name":"Rove HQ Business Bay | Hospitality-Branded Offices"},"banner_image":{"url":"h